        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on employee feedback, we develop action plans at the business unit and facility levels to implement targeted improvements.",
        "start_character": 29210,
        "end_character": 29338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we developed new linehaul models that use artificial intelligence (AI) to improve the efficiency of our freight flows, piloted routing innovations for pickup-and-delivery operations and continued to improve productivity with real-time labor analytics at the service center level.",
        "start_character": 1567,
        "end_character": 1855
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we are in a strong position to create value from all levels of demand for LTL services, and to benefit from secular industrial and retail trends in all parts of the cycle, such as the trend toward shippers increasingly outsourcing freight transportation, the shift toward more frequent LTL shipments versus full truckload freight in some sectors, and an increase in the nearshoring of manufacturing activity to North America.",
        "start_character": 17310,
        "end_character": 17751
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate the business to high service standards for on-time delivery and damage-free transport, while",
        "start_character": 1410,
        "end_character": 1513
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide freight transportation services to approximately 55,000 customers ranging in size from small, entrepreneurial businesses to Fortune 500 companies.",
        "start_character": 15118,
        "end_character": 15275
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We see AI playing a major role in how we operate, price our services, compete, and create value over the long term.",
        "start_character": 5570,
        "end_character": 5685
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We use our proprietary technology to manage these services efficiently within our digital ecosystem in Europe.",
        "start_character": 4328,
        "end_character": 4438
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We use our proprietary technology to provide reliable freight transportation services and make the most of the resources within our company.",
        "start_character": 7672,
        "end_character": 7812
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we foster career development at all levels to recruit and retain high-caliber employees.",
        "start_character": 29570,
        "end_character": 29672
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In foreign jurisdictions where we operate, our operations are regulated by the appropriate governmental authorities.",
        "start_character": 19264,
        "end_character": 19380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "It ensures that we can operate consistently throughout changes in market conditions and deliver what our customers value most — reliable capacity, technology-driven efficiencies and problem-solving expertise.",
        "start_character": 17101,
        "end_character": 17309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001166003-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001166003-26-000016-de4e5f742e97e90c",
        "accession_number": "0001166003-26-000016",
